  "accounting.mapping.emptyState": { id: "Belum ada mapping tersimpan — sistem memakai akun default bawaan.", en: "No mappings saved yet — the system uses the built-in default accounts.", ms: "Belum ada pemetaan disimpan — sistem menggunakan akaun lalai bawaan.", th: "ยังไม่มีการจับคู่ที่บันทึกไว้ — ระบบใช้บัญชีเริ่มต้นของระบบ", fil: "Wala pang na-save na mapping — ginagamit ng sistema ang built-in default accounts.", vi: "Chưa có ánh xạ nào được lưu — hệ thống dùng tài khoản mặc định." },

